      "object": null,
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "The public's expectations about future monetary policy actions matter today because those expectations have important effects on current financial conditions"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "monetary_fiscal",
      "subject": null,
      "action": "clarified",
      "object": "objectives and policy strategy",
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "the Federal Open Market Committee (FOMC) has clarified the Federal Reserve's objectives and policy strategy"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "unknown",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": "Federal Reserve",
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "The financial crisis and its aftermath, however, have raised even greater challenges for, and demands on, the Federal Reserve's communication."
    },
    {
      "event_type": "monetary_fiscal",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": null,
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "The so-called zero lower bound on the FOMC's policy interest rate was not the only challenge the Committee faced."
    },
    {
      "event_type": "monetary_fiscal",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": null,
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "the federal funds rate should be set well below zero, which, of course, was not feasible."
    },
    {
      "event_type": "monetary_fiscal",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": "federal funds rate target",
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "Crossing one of the thresholds will not automatically give rise to an increase in the federal funds rate target"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "unknown",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": null,
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": "unemployment rate",
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "the unemployment rate--which, despite some drawbacks in this regard, is probably the best single summary indicator of the state of the labor market"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "monetary_fiscal",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": null,
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "it became clear early on that more monetary accommodation would be needed than could be provided through the management of short-term rates alone"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "monetary_fiscal",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": "federal funds rate",
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": "close to zero",
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "the FOMC reduced its target for the federal funds rate close to zero"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "unknown",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": null,
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": "large-scale asset purchases",
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "it began supplementing its rate policies and forward rate guidance with large-scale asset purchases (LSAPs)"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "monetary_fiscal",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": "monetary policy",
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "the use of these tools allows monetary policy to be effective even when short-term interest rates are close to zero"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "unknown",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": null,
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "we are somewhat less certain about the magnitudes of the effects on financial conditions and the economy of changes in the pace of purchases"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "guidance",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": null,
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "market participants may have taken the communication in June as indicating a general lessening of the Committee's commitment to maintain a highly accommodative stance of policy in"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "unknown",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": null,
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": "framework",
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "The FOMC applied the framework communicated in June."
    },
    {
      "event_type": "unknown",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": null,
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": "rates",
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "longer-term rates fell and expectations of short-term rates derived from financial market prices showed, and continue to show, a pattern more consistent with the guidance."
    },
